    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Renovated traditional property in a quiet countryside situation.\r\n\r\nThe property is located approx. 6km from Skibbereen and is approached by a shared laneway off the main road.\r\n\r\nThe cottage is surrounded by old stone outbuildings providing a sheltered courtyard area to the rear and a large garden to the front of the house.\r\n\r\nThe house has been renovated throughout and can be rented furnished or unfurnished.\r\n\r\nAccommodation;\r\n\r\nEntrance hall, kitchen / dining room with fitted kitchen units and Belfast sink, American fridge freezer and dining table.  Adjoining this is a utility room with washing machine and dryer and the shower room with el. shower.    There is a sitting room with solid fuel stove.\r\n\r\n1st Floor\r\n\r\nTwo double bedrooms and two single bedrooms or home office space.\r\n\r\nHeating is oil and solid fuel, wifi is available.\r\n\r\nLong term rental, references essential"
      },
